## Something a unit takes into battle to use there: a [Grenade], gone for good
## once thrown, or a [Medkit], used once a battle and kept.
##
## Only a name and a description here. What a kind of battle item does is its
## subclass's: a [Grenade]'s blast is on the grenade, a [Medkit]'s healing on
## the medkit. How many a unit can carry is its item slots, one each.
class_name BattleItem
extends Item
